                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Olkilikuai oipirta Moab. Enkaraki naitomijoonoki enkanasa e Aar te ina kewarie apa naishieki Moab; o enkaraki naitomijoonoki enkanasa e Kir, te ina kewarie apa, naishieki Moab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eshomo ina tito e Dibon iwuejitin neeika aishir; aishiraki Nebo neishiraki Medeba, eishirita Moab. Etabarnoki lukuny enye o lmunyo lenye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore too nkoitoi neishopo ilkuniyiani; ore too nchumat oo nkajijik o too nkisiajat eishirita pooki ng'ae netashala too lkiyio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eishirita Heshbon o Eleale, etoning'e oltoilo le nkishirata enye te Yahas; ore enkaraki ina keishir lelo lewa le Moab oata ruparen aabuaku; Eikirikire oltau lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eishirita oltau lai te nkaraki Moab; ekuetikitia lelo aisikak lenyena Soar, eshomo Eglat-shelishia. Amu ore eilepaki Luhit, nepuo ninche eishir, ore eimita ina oitoi nalo Horonaim neyietu enkishirata e nkidaaroto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "etoito nchorroi e Nimrim; netoito nkujit nemeetae inaabulu, meekure eetae nkaitubulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina, ore nena tokitin kumok apa naanoto ninche, o nena apa naatushuma ninche, keyae ninche aaitalang nchorroi o seyiai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eshomo olkiyioi, aibulu enkop e Moab; etabaikia enkishirata Eglaim, etabaikia enkishirata Beerelim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eiputa nkariak e Dibon osarge, ore ake eyia, kaitoki nanu ayau shumata Dibon aitulusoo, kesuj olng'atuny lelo ooisik le Moab, o ilo pisiai oleku le ina kop.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
